{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24521","headline":"老病幽独偶吟所怀 · 白居易","name":"老病幽独偶吟所怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"眼渐昏昏耳渐聋，满头霜雪半身风。\n已将身出浮云外，犹寄形於逆旅中。\n觞咏罢来宾阁闭，笙歌散後妓房空。\n世缘俗念消除尽，别是人间清净翁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24521.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24521","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}